```http
### ============================================================
### AUTHENTICATION & SECURITY
### ============================================================

### GET Public endpoint - no login required
GET http://localhost:8080/

### GET Obtain CSRF token to add to headers for state-changing requests
### Request a CSRF token before POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE, and logout.
### Only repeat this request if you do not already have a valid XSRF-TOKEN
### or the request returns 403 due to CSRF.
GET http://localhost:8080/csrf

### POST Register New User - no login required
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### POST Login with already existing admin
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

email=admin@example.com&password=Password

### POST Login with registered user
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

email=user@example.com&password=password123

### GET USER ENDPOINT - USER + ADMIN - Login Required
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user

### GET ADMIN ENDPOINT - ADMIN ONLY - Login Required
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin

### POST Logout - Login + CSRF Required
POST http://localhost:8080/logout
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}


### ============================================================
### PATIENT API
### ============================================================

### POST Register a Patient - Login + CSRF Required
POST http://localhost:8080/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "dateOfBirth": "1995-05-15",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "phoneNumber": "0712345678",
  "address": "Nairobi"
}

### GET ALL Patients - Login Required
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients

### GET Patient by ID - Login Required
### patientId must be a valid UUIDv7 returned when the patient was created.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients/{{patientId}}

### GET Search Patient By Phone Number - Login Required
### Pass the phone number as a request parameter.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients/search?phoneNumber={{phoneNumber}}

### GET Search Patient By Phone Number - Login Required
### Pass the phone number as a path variable.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients/phone/{{phoneNumber}}

### PUT Update Patient - Login + CSRF Required
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/patients/{{patientId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Updated",
  "dateOfBirth": "1995-05-15",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "phoneNumber": "0712345678",
  "address": "Updated Address"
}

### DELETE Patient - Login + CSRF Required
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/patients/{{patientId}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}


### ============================================================
### PATIENT ERROR / VALIDATION TESTS
### ============================================================

### POST Register Patient with invalid data
### Expected: 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "",
  "dateOfBirth": null,
  "gender": null,
  "phoneNumber": "",
  "address": ""
}

### POST Register Patient with duplicate phone number
### Expected: 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "firstName": "Another",
  "lastName": "Patient",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-01",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "phoneNumber": "0712345678",
  "address": "Nairobi"
}

### GET Patient with non-existent ID
### Expected: 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients/{{nonExistentPatientId}}

### GET Patient search without phone number
### Expected: 400 Bad Request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients/search

### GET Patient search with blank phone number
### Expected: 400 Bad Request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients/search?phoneNumber=

### GET Patient by non-existent phone number
### Expected: 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients/phone/0799999999

### PUT Update non-existent patient
### Expected: 404 Not Found
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/patients/{{nonExistentPatientId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "firstName": "Updated",
  "lastName": "Patient",
  "dateOfBirth": "1995-05-15",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "phoneNumber": "0799999998",
  "address": "Nairobi"
}

### DELETE non-existent patient
### Expected: 404 Not Found
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/patients/{{nonExistentPatientId}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}


### ============================================================
### ENCOUNTER API
### ============================================================

### POST Start Encounter for Patient - Login + CSRF Required
### patientId must belong to an existing patient.
### Expected: 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{patientId}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### GET Encounter by ID - Login Required
### encounterId must be a valid UUIDv7.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}

### POST Discharge Encounter by ID - Login + CSRF Required
### Expected: 200 OK
### Encounter status should change from ACTIVE to DISCHARGED.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/discharge
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### POST Cancel Encounter by ID - Login + CSRF Required
### Use an ACTIVE encounter for this test.
### Expected: 200 OK
### Encounter status should change from ACTIVE to CANCELLED.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{activeEncounterId}}/cancel
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}


### ============================================================
### ENCOUNTER ERROR TESTS
### ============================================================

### POST Start Encounter for non-existent patient
### Expected: depends on current application-level handling.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{nonExistentPatientId}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### GET Encounter with non-existent ID
### Expected: 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{nonExistentEncounterId}}

### POST Discharge an already discharged encounter
### Expected: 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{dischargedEncounterId}}/discharge
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### POST Cancel an already cancelled encounter
### Expected: 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{cancelledEncounterId}}/cancel
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### POST Cancel an already discharged encounter
### Expected: 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{dischargedEncounterId}}/cancel
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### POST Discharge an already cancelled encounter
### Expected: 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{cancelledEncounterId}}/discharge
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### POST Discharge non-existent encounter
### Expected: 404 Not Found
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{nonExistentEncounterId}}/discharge
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### POST Cancel non-existent encounter
### Expected: 404 Not Found
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{nonExistentEncounterId}}/cancel
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}


### ============================================================
### MEDICAL RECORD API
### ============================================================

### POST Create Medical Record for an Encounter
### Login + CSRF Required
### The encounter must already exist.
### Expected: 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/medical-record
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### GET Medical Record belonging to an Encounter
### Login Required
### Expected: 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/medical-record

### POST Add Vital to Medical Record
### Login + CSRF Required
### type must be a valid VitalType enum value.
### value contains the measured value.
### unit contains the measurement unit.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/medical-record/vitals?type={{vitalType}}&value={{vitalValue}}&unit={{vitalUnit}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### POST Add Clinical Observation to Medical Record
### Login + CSRF Required
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/medical-record/observations?description={{observation}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### POST Add Diagnosis to Medical Record
### Login + CSRF Required
### type must be a valid DiagnosisType enum value.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/medical-record/diagnoses?description={{diagnosisDescription}}&type={{diagnosisType}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### POST Add Treatment to Medical Record
### Login + CSRF Required
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/medical-record/treatments?description={{treatment}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}


### ============================================================
### MEDICAL RECORD ERROR TESTS
### ============================================================

### POST Create Medical Record for non-existent encounter
### Expected: 404 Not Found
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{nonExistentEncounterId}}/medical-record
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### GET Medical Record for encounter without a medical record
### Expected: 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterWithoutMedicalRecordId}}/medical-record

### GET Medical Record for non-existent encounter
### Expected: 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{nonExistentEncounterId}}/medical-record

### POST Create a second Medical Record for the same Encounter
### Expected: 409 Conflict
### The database enforces one medical record per encounter.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/medical-record
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### POST Add Vital to an Encounter without a Medical Record
### Expected: 404 Not Found
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterWithoutMedicalRecordId}}/medical-record/vitals?type={{vitalType}}&value={{vitalValue}}&unit={{vitalUnit}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### POST Add Observation to an Encounter without a Medical Record
### Expected: 404 Not Found
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterWithoutMedicalRecordId}}/medical-record/observations?description={{observation}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### POST Add Diagnosis to an Encounter without a Medical Record
### Expected: 404 Not Found
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterWithoutMedicalRecordId}}/medical-record/diagnoses?description={{diagnosisDescription}}&type={{diagnosisType}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### POST Add Treatment to an Encounter without a Medical Record
### Expected: 404 Not Found
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterWithoutMedicalRecordId}}/medical-record/treatments?description={{treatment}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}


### ============================================================
### MEDICAL RECORD VALIDATION TESTS
### ============================================================

### POST Add Vital with missing type
### Expected: 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/medical-record/vitals?value=120&unit=mmHg
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### POST Add Vital with missing value
### Expected: 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/medical-record/vitals?type={{vitalType}}&unit=mmHg
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### POST Add Vital with missing unit
### Expected: 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/medical-record/vitals?type={{vitalType}}&value=120
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### POST Add Observation with missing description
### Expected: depends on current domain validation.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/medical-record/observations
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### POST Add Diagnosis with missing description
### Expected: depends on current domain validation.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/medical-record/diagnoses?type={{diagnosisType}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### POST Add Diagnosis with missing type
### Expected: 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/medical-record/diagnoses?description={{diagnosisDescription}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### POST Add Treatment with missing description
### Expected: depends on current domain validation.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/medical-record/treatments
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}


### ============================================================
### AUTHORIZATION TESTS
### ============================================================

### GET User endpoint without login
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized or 403 Forbidden,
### depending on the current Spring Security configuration.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user

### GET Admin endpoint as normal user
### Expected: 403 Forbidden
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin

### GET Patient endpoint without login
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized or 403 Forbidden,
### depending on the current Spring Security configuration.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients

### GET Encounter endpoint without login
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized or 403 Forbidden,
### depending on the current Spring Security configuration.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}

### GET Medical Record endpoint without login
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized or 403 Forbidden,
### depending on the current Spring Security configuration.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/medical-record


### ============================================================
### CSRF TESTS
### ============================================================

### POST Start Encounter without CSRF token
### Expected: 403 Forbidden
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{patientId}}

### POST Create Medical Record without CSRF token
### Expected: 403 Forbidden
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/medical-record

### POST Add Vital without CSRF token
### Expected: 403 Forbidden
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/medical-record/vitals?type={{vitalType}}&value={{vitalValue}}&unit={{vitalUnit}}

### PUT Update Patient without CSRF token
### Expected: 403 Forbidden
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/patients/{{patientId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Updated",
  "dateOfBirth": "1995-05-15",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "phoneNumber": "0712345678",
  "address": "Updated Address"
}

### DELETE Patient without CSRF token
### Expected: 403 Forbidden
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/patients/{{patientId}}
```
